<title>USA: Tenn. Housing $30 mln series B won by Oppenheimer. [CORRECTED 01:50 GMT 7/8]</title>
<headline>Tenn. Housing $30 mln series B won by Oppenheimer. [CORRECTED 01:50 GMT 7/8]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects winner of bonds in headline and text from Smith Barney to Oppenheimer.)</p>
<p>Oppenheimer said Wednesday it won $30 million Tennessee Housing Finance Agency series 1996-5B bonds at a true interest cost of 3.8588 percent (corrects from 3.898 percent).</p>
</text>
